OL,3,GNEWSAChild suffers head injury in
OL,4,Ahit-and-run collision
OL,5,
OL,6,FA child suffered a head injury when
OL,7,Fstruck by a car while crossing the road
OL,8,Fin a hit-and-run collision.
OL,10,FThe crash happened on Clayton Road,
OL,11,FNewcastle-under-Lyme, near to Clayton
OL,12,FHall Academy, at 15:20 BST on Friday,
OL,13,FStaffordshire Police said. The child
OL,14,Fwas taken to hospital with a head and
OL,15,Fleg injury.
OL,17,FThe small black car drove off towards
OL,18,FNewcastle Road, in the direction of M6
OL,19,Fmotorway, following the non-stop
OL,20,Fcollision, said the force.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
